lead   | e4/1 d4 c#4 d4 e4 f#4 g4 e4 | f#4/1 e4 d4 e4 f#4 g4 a4 f#4 | g4/1 e4 c#4 e4 a4/2 g4 | f#4/2 d4 r/4 |
bass   | a2/4 e2       | d2/4 a1       | a2/4 e2       | d2/4 r        |
chords | r/2 [c#4,e4,g4]' r [c#4,e4,g4]' | r/2 [d4,f#4,a4]' r [d4,f#4,a4]' | r/2 [c#4,e4,g4]' r [c#4,e4,g4]' | r/2 [d4,f#4,a4]' r/4 |
drums  | T/2 W r W     | r/2 W r W     | T/2 W r W     | r/2 W D/4     |
'''

[pattern.A2]
score = '''
lead   | e5/2 r/4 e4/2 | e5/2 r/4 [d#5!,e5]/2 | [d5,e5]/2 [c#5,e5] [b4,e5] [a4,e5] | [e4,g#4,e5]/2 r/4 g#4/2 |
second | r/8           | r/8           | r/8           | r/6 e4/2      |
